  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "intro-1",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Back door clicks; one warm step lands beside the garden bed.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro-2",
      "sectionId": "intro",
      "text": "Nothing is far away when you kneel down close.",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-A",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "At the back step, A — Apron! Cloth front ready | a small shield for water and soil splashes.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-B",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Beside the trellis, B ... B ... Bean! Tendrils reach | pods hide among the leaves.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-C",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "Close to the bed, C is Compost. Dark, crumbly material | broken-down scraps help enrich the soil.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-D",
      "sectionId": "r1-a-d",
      "text": "D? Daisy! Round center, simple petal ring | a small white bloom above the grass.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-E",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Around the corner, E — Eggplant. Broad leaves make shade | glossy fruit hangs low beneath them.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-F",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "F ... F ... Flower! Get eye-level with the bloom | petals frame the flower's center.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-G",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "Along the path, G is Garden Hose. Long flexible curve | water travels through it from tap to plants.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-H",
      "sectionId": "r1-e-h",
      "text": "H? Hoe! Leaning where adults keep garden tools | a long handle we identify from a safe distance.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "Backyard small, backyard wide—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-2-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-2",
      "text": "A whole little world is waiting just outside.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-I",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "At the fence, I — Ivy. Climb and cling | green leaves trail along the vertical edge.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-J",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "J ... J ... Jug! On the little table, handle and narrow mouth | ready for a careful pour.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-K",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "K? Kneeling Pad! Down at child height | soft cushion between knees and hard ground.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-L",
      "sectionId": "r1-i-l",
      "text": "Beside the path, L is Lavender. Purple spikes brush the air | narrow leaves carry a familiar scent.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-M",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "M — Marigold! Orange-gold bloom close to the border | color packed into a round flower head.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-N",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "Look higher for N ... N ... Nest! Twigs make a cup | a bird home we watch without disturbing.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-O",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "O? Orchid! In a pot near the shade | a distinctive bloom opens around one special central lip.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-P",
      "sectionId": "r1-m-p",
      "text": "P is Pot. Round wall, soil inside | a small container giving roots one bounded place.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Q",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "At the sunny side, Q — Quince. Firm yellow fruit | growing on a shrub or small tree.",
      "targetId": "Q",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-R",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "R ... R ... Radish! Pull the view underground | crisp root below, leaves above.",
      "targetId": "R",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-S",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "Close-up S? Seed! Tiny coat in our fingertips | a plant beginning small enough to miss.",
      "targetId": "S",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-T",
      "sectionId": "r1-q-t",
      "text": "T is Tomato. Green branch, round fruit | a backyard snack growing above the soil.",
      "targetId": "T",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-5-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-5",
      "text": "Backyard small, backyard wide—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-5-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-5",
      "text": "A whole little world is waiting just outside.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-U",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "Under the eaves, U — Umbrella Plant. Leaf clusters spread | little green canopies above the pot.",
      "targetId": "U",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-V",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "V ... V ... Violet! Low by the edge | a small bloom in purple, blue, white, or yellow.",
      "targetId": "V",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-W",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "Kneel closer for W — Worm. Wiggle through moist soil | soft body tunneling under our feet.",
      "targetId": "W",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-X",
      "sectionId": "r1-u-x",
      "text": "Back by the step, X is Xylem—tiny tubes carry water upward inside a garden stem.",
      "targetId": "X",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Y",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Y ... Y ... Yarrow! Many tiny flowers gather flat | a cluster larger than each bloom alone.",
      "targetId": "Y",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-Z",
      "sectionId": "r1-y-z",
      "text": "Last close-up, Z? Zinnia! Layered petals ring the center | bright beside the path home.",
      "targetId": "Z",
      "objective": "lexical-semantic",
      "objectReveal": "line-start"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "Backyard small, backyard wide—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r1-7-2",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r1-7",
      "text": "A whole little world is waiting just outside.",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "interlude-1",
      "sectionId": "mid-interlude",
      "text": "Kneel down close for one quiet beat—what backyard clues come back?",
      "objective": "narration",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-A",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Backyard clue A ... Apron! Trace a little apron shape on your shirt.",
      "targetId": "A",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-B",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Look close, B ... Bean! Pretend to pick it gently, then show the picture.",
      "targetId": "B",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-C",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Close-up C? ... Compost! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "C",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-D",
      "sectionId": "r2-a-d",
      "text": "Find D ... Daisy! Open both hands like a flower.",
      "targetId": "D",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-E",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Backyard clue E ... Eggplant! Pretend to pick it gently, then show the picture.",
      "targetId": "E",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-F",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Look close, F ... Flower! Open both hands like a flower.",
      "targetId": "F",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-G",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Close-up G? ... Garden Hose! Trace one long wavy hose.",
      "targetId": "G",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-H",
      "sectionId": "r2-e-h",
      "text": "Find H ... Hoe! Point to the picture and name its job.",
      "targetId": "H",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-I",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Backyard clue I ... Ivy! Grow one hand upward, then sway.",
      "targetId": "I",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-J",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Look close, J ... Jug! Mime one gentle pouring motion.",
      "targetId": "J",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-K",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Close-up K? ... Kneeling Pad! Point to the matching picture, then make one small shape gesture.",
      "targetId": "K",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-L",
      "sectionId": "r2-i-l",
      "text": "Find L ... Lavender! Open both hands like a flower.",
      "targetId": "L",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-M",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Backyard clue M ... Marigold! Open both hands like a flower.",
      "targetId": "M",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-N",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Look close, N ... Nest! Cup both hands like a nest.",
      "targetId": "N",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-O",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Close-up O? ... Orchid! Open both hands like a flower.",
      "targetId": "O",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "r2-P",
      "sectionId": "r2-m-p",
      "text": "Find P ... Pot! Cup both hands like a plant pot.",
      "targetId": "P",
      "objective": "retrieval-action",
      "objectReveal": "target-word"
    },
    {
      "id": "chorus-r2-4-1",
      "sectionId": "chorus-r2-4",
      "text": "Backyard small, backyard wide—A-B-C!",
      "objective": "verbatim",
      "objectReveal": "none"
    },
    {
